    "homeType": "MULTI_FAMILY",
    "description": "Conway Real Estate welcomes you to tour our 2700 sq.ft, 3 unit property at the borders of Noe and Eureka Valley's on the best block of Hill Street. This signature investment property offers a 1400 sq.ft. 2 bedrooms and 2.5 bath in a great room design with a 3rd floor master bedroom loft. The greatroom offers an equisite kitchen space with Sub-Zero built-in fridge and Wolf gas range and oven with a generous dining area with an outside deck. A spacious livingroom leads to large double glass doors that exit to a raised private deck overlooking a common area rear garden surrounded by lovely, well-kept neighboring gardens and yards creating a park-like setting. This unit has enclosed parking privileges and an EV charging station. The 1st floor 900 sq.ft. owners unit offers 2  bedrooms and 2 full baths with a newly remodelled kitchen, new vinyl windows, luxury laminate floors and a new electric fireplace insert. This unit can access the interior garage with dedicated storage shelves for each unit. Garage contains 3 new Rinaii tankless water heaters and a washer and dryer. This unit can access the rear common area garden from the master bath. The final unit is a second floor, 300 sq. ft. studio with full kitchen, bath and an elevated sleeping loft with rights to all common area."
  },
